message: "If you use this software, question set or results, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Interpretability Research: A Visual Map of What Activates Inside an LLM"
abstract: >-
  An open-source mechanistic interpretability project with interactive
  visualizations that show which layers, attention heads and MLPs are active,
  which contribute to a language model's answer, and which are causally
  important, starting with GPT-2 small and the Pythia model suite.
